        "filing_date": "2025-11-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Certain rules and procedures imposed by the National Fire Protection Association, as well as comparable state laws and regulations, govern the safe handling of propane, distillates (fuel oil, kerosene and diesel fuel) and gasoline and establish industry standards for propane, fuel oil, kerosene, diesel fuel and gasoline storage, distribution and equipment installation and operation in all of the states in which we operate or sell those products.",
