        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our strategic investments and collaborations with key participants in the renewable energy sector, we have begun to develop an interconnected portfolio of renewable energy assets that are focused on the distribution of renewable liquid fuels, such as renewable propane and rDME, as well as clean hydrogen and RNG.",
